  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "这是一款儿童DIY拼插帐篷搭建套装，采用PP材质，适合搭建房屋，帐篷和通道类结构，适用于家庭互动。",
      "该款DIY拼插帐篷搭建套装以杆件拼插结构为核心，能够快速搭建帐篷，房屋和通道等造型。",
      "产品可用于家庭亲子，课堂教具和室内外活动场景，覆盖益智训练，空间认知与协作搭建等玩法，支持反复拆装使用。",
      "关键参数包括拼砌玩具类型拆装房子、是否有动漫形象否、材质PP。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This is a kids DIY interlocking fort building set made of PP material, suitable for house, tent, and tunnel-style builds in family interaction, classroom activities.",
      "This is a kids DIY interlocking fort building set made of PP material, suitable for house, tent, and tunnel-style builds in family interaction.",
      "This DIY fort building set is based on an interlocking rod structure and allows quick setup of tent, house.",
      "It can be used for parent-child activities, classroom props, and indoor/outdoor event play, covering educational practice, spatial cognition."
